<title>USA: TABLE-Marsh Supermarkets Q2 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Marsh Supermarkets Q2 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve weeks ended</p>
<p>			 June 21 1997	    June 22 1996</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.34     loss	 $0.85</p>
<p> Shr dil profit	    0.32     loss	  0.85</p>
<p> Net     profit	   2,899     loss	 7,112</p>
<p> Revs		     343,924		  335,844</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,748		    8,395</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The oustanding shares figures are fully-diluted. The company said the net loss for the 12 weeks ended June 22 1996 included unspecified reorganization charges. The company's full name is Marsh Supermarkets Inc.</p>
